# Ignore rules for `docker build -f web/Dockerfile .` (context = repository root).
# BuildKit reads "<Dockerfile name>.dockerignore" next to the Dockerfile in preference to a root .dockerignore.
# The Dockerfile only COPYs web/, shared/ and assets/: everything else (the other apps, backups/ with
# production database dumps, e2e/node_modules, firmware, .git ...) never reaches the build daemon.
*
!web
!shared
!assets

web/Dockerfile.dockerignore
**/.DS_Store
**/node_modules
shared/tools
assets/**/*.psd
assets/**/*.ai
